---
import Button from '@components/ui/Button.astro';
---

<section data-testid="reflection" id="reflection" class="py-20 lg:py-28">

	<div class="rounded-3xl bg-gray-50 p-8 dark:bg-gray-900 lg:p-14">
		<p class="mb-3 text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-orange">05 — Reflection</p>
		<h2 class="mb-10 font-monospace text-3xl text-black dark:text-white lg:text-5xl">
			What we learned
		</h2>

		<div class="mb-12 grid gap-6 lg:grid-cols-3">
			<div class="rounded-2xl border border-gray-200 bg-white p-7 shadow-sm dark:border-gray-700 dark:bg-gray-800">
				<p class="mb-3 text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-orange">What worked</p>
				<p class="mb-3 font-semibold text-black dark:text-white">A counterintuitive north star</p>
				<p class="text-sm leading-relaxed text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400">
					Grounding every decision in one specific, counterintuitive research finding — conversational
					fit matters more than food preference — gave the team a shared reference point. Every field
					label and feature could be evaluated against that single principle.
				</p>
			</div>
			<div class="rounded-2xl border border-gray-200 bg-white p-7 shadow-sm dark:border-gray-700 dark:bg-gray-800">
				<p class="mb-3 text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-orange">What we'd do differently</p>
				<p class="mb-3 font-semibold text-black dark:text-white">Broader participant pool, earlier metrics</p>
				<p class="text-sm leading-relaxed text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400">
					Our participants skewed toward Chinese international students, limiting generalizability. A
					more diverse sample would have surfaced different safety concerns and dining norms. We'd
					also introduce quantitative metrics (SUS, task completion rates) earlier in the process.
				</p>
			</div>
			<div class="rounded-2xl border border-gray-200 bg-white p-7 shadow-sm dark:border-gray-700 dark:bg-gray-800">
				<p class="mb-3 text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-orange">What's next</p>
				<p class="mb-3 font-semibold text-black dark:text-white">Matching, verification, empty states</p>
				<p class="text-sm leading-relaxed text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400">
					A matching algorithm surfacing compatible companions based on conversational style. Verified
					profiles to address safety concerns. An empty-state experience for newly created events
					with no joiners yet.
				</p>
			</div>
		</div>

		<div class="flex flex-col items-center gap-5 border-t border-gray-200 pt-12 text-center dark:border-gray-700">
			<p class="font-monospace text-xl text-black dark:text-white">
				Ready to explore the full interactive prototype?
			</p>
			<a
				href="https://www.figma.com/proto/GHEjNtXC88rwqjANMyj82r/PalUp?node-id=628-2444&t=9MffpE68rPn1Mh8K-1"
				target="_blank"
				rel="noopener"
			>
				<Button style={'primary'} size={'lg'} name="View Prototype">View Interactive Prototype →</Button>
			</a>
		</div>
	</div>
</section>
